  "details": "Description\n\nHidden groups are not displayed in own profile in VRChat client. I verified it by checking my profile on the VRChat website.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Open Quick Menu\n\n2. Open own profile\n\n3. Select any group\n\n4. Open group settings\n\n5. Change visibility to Hidden\n\n6. Open own profile\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p1-1920-5a72154dad-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-08_16-04-14.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_7194f92f-5101-42dd-9cbd-9ee789818152/1/file)",
